Revision history for Raku::LanguageServer

{{$NEXT}}
    - Initial version: a RakuAST-powered Language Server Protocol server.
    - JSON-RPC 2.0 over stdio with Content-Length framing; full lifecycle.
    - Features: diagnostics, document/workspace symbols, hover, completion,
      go-to-definition, references, rename, signature help, semantic tokens,
      folding ranges, and deparse-based formatting.
    - bin/raku-language-server entry point; editor wiring docs in the README.
